OL,3,APope begins lengthy trip to Latin
OL,4,AAmerica weeks after lung cancer surgery
OL,5,
OL,6,FPope Leo XIV is beginning a lengthy
OL,7,Ftrip to Latin America just three weeks
OL,8,Fafter surgery for lung cancer - a tour
OL,9,Fthat includes a much-anticipated
OL,10,F"homecoming" to Peru where he was a
OL,11,Fpriest for many years.
OL,13,FThe Vatican says no extraordinary
OL,14,Fmeasures are being taken in relation to
OL,15,Fthe Pope's health, describing him as a
OL,16,F"71-year-old who has undergone an
OL,17,Foperation" not someone with a
OL,18,F"permanent medical condition".
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
